    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d107">

                <pb facs="0140" n="124" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg124"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.113/10–2747</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Secretary of the Army</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Royall</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-10-27">October 27,
                        1947</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: The question of the
                    position to be taken with respect to requests which may be made by the other
                    American Republics for assistance in establishing arms manufacturing plants has
                    been considered in the Department of State. There is enclosed for your
                    information policy and procedure which has been approved with respect to this
                    subject.</p>
                <p>You will note that the wording of this policy and procedure prescribes that each
                    request for assistance will be handled separately.</p>
                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles</hi> E. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Saltzman</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Assistant Secretary</hi>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d107-a1.xml" xpointer="d107-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
